# ENVELOPE model - NOT vendor CAD. Thonkiconn WQP518MA mono jack.
# Body box + bushing cylinder for the tscircuit 3D view; the vendor STEP
# (library/cad/*/SOURCE.md, clacktronics/AudioJacks MIT) loads but does not
# mesh in that viewer. Body 9.0 x 10.45mm from the library CAD F.Fab outline;
# thread Ø6.4 from the vendor STEP's cylinder radii; body top 6.5 and shoulder
# 9.0 (+0.6 thread stub) from the STEP profile and doc/MECHANICAL-STACK.md.
# Origin = barrel axis on the board surface. Units: mm.
